{
  "_comment": [
    "MiniMax-H3 REF2VA: prompt + up to nine reference images -> video WITH",
    "audio. The sibling of minimax_h3_i2v_gguf.json, which animates one",
    "opening frame; this one carries subjects and scenes across from",
    "references the prompt addresses as <Picture 1>..<Picture 9>.",
    "",
    "ComfyUI's MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo takes those images through an",
    "Autogrow input, whose API-format keys are namespaced under the parent",
    "input and ZERO-indexed: ref_images.ref_image_0 is <Picture 1>. Flat",
    "ref_image_N keys pass validation and then fail at execute.",
    "",
    "Slots the request does not fill are removed with --drop-node, which",
    "deletes the LoadImage and the consumer's input key with it.",
    "",
    "There is no LoRA node: the REF2VA transformer this graph loads carries",
    "the 4-step distill in its weights."
  ],
